BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Glow-in-the-Dark Paint Pouring on Bears & Canvas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T173000
UID:blogto-235418@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/22/original_image27fdfc12-eb48-4c03-8deb-4578c39554
 17.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Go outside the box at Artbox’s Glow-in-the-Dark Paint Pourin
 g Workshop and create a one-of-a-kind fluid art piece that can never be re
 created.\nEnjoy our vibrant 2-level gallery\, enjoy snacks\, coffee/tea\, 
 before diving into the mesmerizing experience of glowing paint pouring. Le
 arn essential techniques such as flip cup\, paint blowing\, and intentiona
 l pours\, along with colour mixing and flow methods—all guided by our in
 structor.\nDuration:\n• Approx. 1.5- 2 hours (depending on quantity of p
 roject choices)\nWhat’s Included:\n• Project choices include an 11x14
 ” stretched canvas and/or white fluid bear\, KAWS Figurine and fluid key
 chain.\n• Glow-in-the-dark\, neon and acrylic paints\, pouring mediums\,
  glitter\, gold/silver leaf\n• Apron and all supplies\n• Snacks\, coff
 ee\, tea\, and refreshments\nYour artwork is welcome to stay to dry safely
  or can be packed to-go\, same day. Your art will fully dry within 24 hour
 s.\nWho Can Attend:\nOpen to beginners and experienced artists alike. Ages
  10+ (ages 10–16 must attend with a paying 18+ adult).\nSee more events 
 at: https://www.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at: 647-617-9550
LOCATION:Artbox Studio Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-glow-in-the-dark-paint-pouring-on-bear
 s-canvas-toronto-38/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Kids & Family Glow Paint: Self-Guided
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T130000
UID:blogto-235439@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/22/original_imageb803a256-bbc6-40c8-91f0-e76b6724b9
 05.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Lights off\, creativity on! Let your little artist shine at th
 is fun-filled glow-in-the-dark art experience at Artbox!\nWhat to Expect: 
 This kid-friendly workshop combines art and UV lights for a creative\, sen
 sory experience like no other. In our glow studio\, you will use neons and
  glow-in-the-dark paints to bring your canvas to life in a bold & brillian
 t way.\nSelf-Guidance: Enjoy the freedom of painting anything you want wit
 h an instructor on hand to help you make your vision come to life. Trace a
 n image before or freehand your art. We encourage freedom of expression in
  a safe\, supervised\, and inspiring environment—no experience needed!\n
 All Supplies Included: We provide all necessary supplies\, including neon 
 and glow-in-the-dark paints\, brushes\, craft materials\, aprons\, and mor
 e. Wear white or neon to glow\, and clothing that is okay to get a little 
 art on.\nWho Should Join: Open to anyone aged 4+. At least one 18+ adult m
 ust accompany kids under 16. Families are encouraged to sign up together 
 — kids and parents are welcome to share a canvas or get their own. Reser
 ve your spot today!\nPlease note\, this session is hosted in our art galle
 ry and no one is permitted to touch the art.\nIf you are interested in tra
 cing\, feel free to email us a picture of what you want to trace and paint
  by responding to your confirmation email.\nSee more events at: https://ww
 w.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at: 647-617-9550
LOCATION:Artbox Studio Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-kids-family-glow-paint-self-guided-tor
 onto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All Killer No Filler: The Art of the Running Order with Chris Earl
 e
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T150000
UID:blogto-236181@blogto.com
