 fb.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for paint night at mid-town Toronto’s paint studio 
 – My Inner Child Paint Bar.  Our paint and sip classes encourage you to 
 explore your Inner Artist whether you’re an experienced painter or haven
 ’t picked up a paint brush since elementary school.  We promise a fun-fi
 lled evening of artistic expression\, drink\, and music in a relaxed atmos
 phere.   Owner/artist\, Claire\, at My Inner Child believes that everyone 
 can paint as we all used to do when we were little\, we just need to tap i
 nto our INNER CHILD.   Art is fun.  Art is expressive.  Art is creative.  
  Art is healing.\nOur paint nites are ideal for date night\, girl’s nigh
 t out and anyone looking to try something different.\nThe class is expecte
 d to take about 2.5 hours to complete\, however\, we guarantee extra studi
 o time to allow you to put the final touches on your masterpiece.\nWe are 
 conveniently located in mid-town Toronto\, at 2725 Yonge Street north of E
 glinton.    There is plenty of cheap parking underground in the building a
 s well as ample street parking.
