 guided instruction and a relaxed\, welcoming atmosphere\, you’ll be supp
 orted every step of the way as you create a one-of-a-kind glowing masterpi
 ece—no painting experience required.\nWhat’s Included:\n• Guided glo
 w-in-the-dark painting experience\n• All art materials provided\n• Sna
