DESCRIPTION:Shab-e She’r (Poetry Night) is Canada’s most diverse & bra
 ve poetry reading + open mic series\nFeatured poets: Lara Bozabalian & Sur
 veyor Efik\n+ Open Mic for poetry in any language\nHost: Bänoo Zan\nTime:
  Tuesday\, June 16\, 2026\nPlace: Living Room\, Tranzac Club\, 292 Brunswi
