 UZU Pizzeria. Inspired by retro diner discos\, hot summer nights\, melting
  ice cream cones\, and carefree queer joy\, ZUZU transforms into the ultim
 ate summer social\, where the party starts with bingo and ends on the danc
 e floor.\nEVENT FLOW ✨\n6:00 PM — Doors Open\n6:30 PM – 8:00 PM — 
 QE Drag Bingo Hosted by Sucka Queen & Guy Anabella\n*3–4 rounds of drag 
