 up\, and the party keeps going.\nON THE BEATS:\nDJ ThirdEye\nDj Kamal\nON 
 THE MENU 🍕🍦\nScoops & Slices featuring:\n• Pizza by the slice\n•
  Pride-themed scoops\n• Boozy milkshakes\n• Summer cocktails\nTHE VIBE
 \n• Retro / 90’s-inspired summer party\n• Diner disco energy\n• Ch
 eeky photo moments\n• Patio games & dancing\n• A playful\, welcoming q
 ueer celebration\nOUR STAND 🌈\nAt Café ZUZU Pizzeria\, we’ve always 
 stood up for our values of equity\, accessibility\, and community. Rooted 
 in Regent Park\, we’re proud to continue creating joyful spaces that cel
 ebrate and uplift the communities we love.\nRULES OF ENGAGEMENT 💖\nWe b
 elieve we’re all made better by the diversity in our communities. Our sp
 aces are grounded in respect\, inclusion\, and celebration of individualit
 y. We hold a zero-tolerance policy for discrimination or disrespect of any
  kind toward guests\, vendors\, performers\, or team members.\nPARTNERS OF
