BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:If Not You\, Then Who? An Evening of Connection
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T210000
UID:blogto-235951@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/03/original_imagea39c739d-38e8-488a-af65-8379f9e4c8
 e4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:What happens when a room full of women stops waiting for permi
 ssion?\nOn June 17\, If Not You\, Then Who? brings together some of Canada
 's most inspiring voices for an evening of candid conversation about confi
 dence\, ambition\, identity\, reinvention\, and the evolving definition of
  success.\nCreated and hosted by Margot Grant Witz\, Vice President of Eli
 zabeth Grant Skin Care and a leading voice in the pro-aging movement\, the
  event explores a question many women quietly wrestle with: Why do we so o
 ften value someone else's "no" more than our own "yes"?\nJoining Margot fo
 r an intimate evening of keynotes and conversation are fashion icon Jeanne
  Beker\, media personality and podcast host Taylor Kaye\, entrepreneur Dan
 i Kagan\, Co-Founder of Mave & Chez\, and bestselling author and media exe
 cutive Bryce Gruber. The evening will be emceed by Alana Kayfetz of The Mo
 m Halo.\nTogether\, they'll explore the realities of modern womanhood\, in
 cluding confidence at every stage of life\, self-worth\, the mental load w
 omen carry\, balancing ambition with fulfillment\, and redefining success 
 on your own terms.\nMore than a networking event\, If Not You\, Then Who? 
 is designed as a space for connection\, reflection\, and meaningful conver
 sation among women navigating careers\, motherhood\, relationships\, reinv
 ention\, and personal growth.\nThe event takes place Wednesday\, June 17\,
  2026\, from 6:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. at Edwards Gardens (Toronto Botanical 
 Garden). Tickets are $36\, with a portion of proceeds supporting Princess 
 Margaret Cancer Centre. Guests will enjoy light refreshments\, complimenta
 ry parking\, and a curated gift bag featuring products from Elizabeth Gran
 t Skin Care and participating partners.
LOCATION:Toronto Botanical Garden
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/if-not-you-then-who-an-evening-of-connec
 tion-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
