 f7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join Alex Lakusta and his trio for 2 sets of music.\n8pm start
 . Tickets at door\nToronto bassist and composer Alex Lakusta brings a rare
  fluidity to instrumental music—where jazz\, rock\, and electronic sensi
 bilities converge in ways that feel both familiar and freshly imagined. Be
 fore releasing his 2022 debut Transmit Slow\, Lakusta spent years collabor
 ating and touring across a wide range of projects at home and abroad\, car
 ving out a place within Canada’s creative circles. His ability to move s
 eamlessly between genres and styles has earned him a reputation for playin
 g that is as unrelenting as it is intuitive—a hallmark that now defines 
 his work as a composer and bandleader.
LOCATION:The Bluebird
