BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Days:  Group Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T170000
UID:blogto-234775@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/07/original_imaged82cd75d-f2b8-4c09-b684-5dee9e0071
 48.jpg
DESCRIPTION:June 18 - July 8\, 2026\nAs the days stretch longer and the wo
 rld opens up\, the Summer Days group exhibition captures the distinct ener
 gy\, warmth\, and reflection of the summer season. This group exhibition b
 rings together over 25 of Muse gallery’s artists working across painting
 \, sculpture\, and mixed media to explore transformation\, vitality\, grow
 th\, the ephemeral nature of light along with themes of rest and rejuvenat
 ion. While each artist possesses a distinct visual voice\, his or her work
  converges here to offer a multi-faceted look at summer. Through their uni
 que use of various media the artists invite viewers to reflect on their re
 lationship to the nature and the passage of time.\nUltimately\, this group
  summer show serves as both a visual celebration and a conceptual space fo
 r dialogue. We invite you to wander through the space\, engage with the di
 verse narratives presented\, and experience the season through the distinc
 t lenses of these talented creators.
LOCATION:Muse Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/summer-days-group-show-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Funning: Comedy\, Stories\, Laughs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T213000
UID:blogto-236407@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/11/original_imagefcf383d6-5d02-4c98-8e8f-041ab9fb30
 4a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A night of summer comedy presented by long running troupe Virt
 ual Man Hugs. Featuring hilarious improvised comedy and storytelling from 
 Toronto funniest performers. Get your drinks\, grab a seat\, and get ready
  to laugh!\nFEATURING\nNatasha Bromfield\, Diane Janisse\, Janet Mac\, Hae
 m Roy\, Ana Luiza Valente\nYou've seen theses ladies in improv shows acros
 s Toronto. They join forces for ONE NIGHT ONLY for a mighty fierce improv 
 set.\n@pewpewpew.comedy\nThey are hot. They are rising. They got their sta
 rt in a church basement. Come see this talented improv ensemble.\nThe Math
  Men (Jeff Rosenthal & Emile LeBlanc)\nWatch these two real life career ma
 thematicians do what they trained their entire careers to do: Improvise hi
 larious Shakespeare-themed comedy? Oh yes\, for real!\nDiane Janisse - Sto
 rytelling\nStoryteller Diane Janisse will tell wonderful and funny stories
  drawn from her personal life. She is a Toronto based improviser\, storyte
 ller and sometimes lawyer.\nA graduate of Second City's comedy program Dia
 ne began her storytelling journey two years ago and has been in love with 
 it every since.\nVIRTUAL MAN HUGS (Gary Chan\, Jorge Moreira\, David Phalp
 \, Jeff Rosenthal)\nYour hosts and headliners will improvise hilarious sce
 nes based on the stories of our special guest Diane Janisse. First enjoy t
 he delightful stories by Diane. Then see the side-splitting takes on them 
 performed by Virtual Man Hugs. These improv veterans will leave you laughi
 ng with their fast wits\, wacky characters\, and surprising takes\, all ma
 de up on the spot.\n8PM Thu Jun 18\nSocap Comedy Theatre\, 2nd Floor\n154 
 Danforth Ave\nTix $15 or 2-for-1.
LOCATION:Social Capital Theatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/summer-funning-comedy-stories-laughs-tor
 onto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
