ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/11/original_imagedd605c38-3b10-438e-950c-be6cadfee8
 ab.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Grab your rosé or N.A. Loverboy and come DISH with some of To
 ronto's top comics who are JUST as obsessed with Summer House as you are!\
 nWhether you are a Wirkus twins OG or new to the fold from this bonkers se
 ason 10\, this show is for you.\nWe're talking:\n- the "announcement"\n- b
 utter yellow dress and OFC the half bun\n- AJ and Dara (</3)\n...AND SO MU
 CH MORE\nFeaturing:\n- Charmaine Davie\n- Michelle Forrester\n- Isabel Zaw
 -Tun\n- Gabe Meacher\n- Dan James\nHosted and produced by Toronto comedian
  and Bravo enthusiast Anna Sebastien (@annasebastiencomedy).\nThe venue:\n
 - The show takes place in the theatre space in the downstairs area of Tall
 boys. Take a left when you walk in and head downstairs!\n- The venue unfor
 tunately has a few barriers to access. There is a large step to enter the 
 main bar area. The theatre space and washrooms are located down a staircas
 e\, with tight corners from the bottom landing to the theatre. There is al
 so a single step from the basement hallway into the venue room. Once insid
 e\, there is no grade change.\n- There is a communal gender neutral washro
 om with urinals and toilets\, a singe stall unmarked gender neutral washro
 om with a toilet\, and a woman's washroom with toilets.\n- Seating is self
 -assigned and the venue is intimate\, so we recommend groups arrive early 
 so they can grab seats together
