 ntures and secrets we’ve all hidden away. This is a great show for a nig
 ht out with friends or a fun date night\, where we’ll be fueling the com
 edy with real-life stories submitted by our audience (anonymously\, of cou
 rse) about everything they've kept hidden away! Secrets revealed at our pr
 evious shows include:\n– “I have two boyfriends who are stationed at t
 he same military base”\n– “I faked a job offer letter to get a raise
  at my current job”\n– “I sell feet pics to pay my rent”\nEach per
