 der: what if? What if I had married Todd from Accounting? What if I never 
 returned from my gap year in Madrid? What if I had joined that cult with S
 andra?\nWell\, now is your chance to go back in time and say YES—through
  musical improv! Inspired by the musical If/Then\, join RATS! Another Musi
 cal? as they take one audience member's major life decision and improvise 
 through both sides of the coin in two simultaneous\, hilarious\, heartfelt
  and music-filled explorations of a complete stranger's life.
