 64.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto 2SLGBTQIA+ Extravaganza is one of the longest-runn
 ing queer board game nights in Canada. Our events are community first. How
 ever you identify on the 2SLGBTQIA+ spectrum\, there is space for you here
 .\nWhether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of board games\, th
 is event offers something for everyone. Discover new games\, challenge you
 r friends\, and make new connections with fellow board game lovers along t
 he way. Come as a group or solo and we can help pair you with a community 
 table. Our events are a great way to connect with members of local communi
 ties and are perfect for folks arriving in Toronto looking to meet new peo
 ple.\nFrom classic favourites to modern hits\, we will have a wide selecti
 on of games to choose from including Coup\, Codenames\, Splendor\, Catan\,
  Love Letter\, and many more! You are welcome to bring games from your own
  collection if you wish.\nTickets for this event include access to a Cake 
 Cabaret\, a curated collection of board games and on-site game volunteers 
 who can help you with player introductions\, game selection\, and running 
 how-to-plays for your table. Cake Cabaret has a wonderful selection of bot
 h alcoholic and non-alcoholic drink options and slices of cake available\,
  while we will have pizza for purchase as well.\nTo learn more\, visit our
  Eventbrite or click the website link to see this event (see right side on
  desktop/above on mobile).
LOCATION:Cake Cabaret
