BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1st Bike Party Toronto of 2026! The June Edition!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T235900
UID:blogto-236383@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/10/original_imagef71238bf-0e82-4fd4-b92a-741f7e9137
 5d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:You\, a bicycle\, music\, lights and lots of new friends sprea
 ding good vibes! Oh\, and an adventure on a mystery route - that's Bike Pa
 rty Toronto in a nutshell!\nIf you've seen us\, you know it's awesomely fu
 n times\, but it's up to YOU to bring the good times and fun! Together we 
 make ridiculous fun happen!\nSo bring your bicycle\, a speaker\, a bike fr
 iendly costume if you'd like\, a spare inner tube\, some snacks and hydrat
 ion and we meet up\, do a music countdown and head out as a group onto the
  streets in Toronto as well as ducking through parks and anywhere else we 
 please! We'll have pit stops and dance parties along the way on this eveni
 ng\, social cycling event! It's not a particularly difficult route and we 
 typically get riders of all ages and experience levels!\nSo how do you get
  to participate in this event that is a regular on the 'best of Toronto' l
 ists?\n1. Follow the links to http://bikeparty.ca & sign up to the mailing
  list\n2. Donate to help make the event sustainable and unlock surprises!\
 n3. Follow our socials for updates. All the rest of the relevant info ends
  up in your email inbox like magic!\nDetails:\nMeetup at 7:30pm (or earlie
 r if you'd like) on Saturday June 20 2026. We'll announce the meetup spots
  via email. Allow some time for yourself to set up your bikes with all the
  glow\, blinkie\, light-up stuff you can cram on your bike.\nWe'll try to 
 synchronize our sound systems & then we ride. How? The playlist will be po
 sted on our socials. Download it to your device\, share it\, spread it. At
  our meeting spot\, we'll all try to hit play at the same time & off we go
 ! Prefer to play your own tunes? That's cool too\, but there definitely is
  a lot of fun in seeing how all the systems large & small drift in and out
  of sync!\nThere will be stops & catch-up points so above all\, be safe & 
 watch out for yourself & fellow riders. It's not a difficult ride\, but as
  always\, come prepared.\nHashtag your social media to find pics of yourse
 lf & fellow riders!\n#BikePartyTO #BikePartyToronto #BikeParty\nCheck http
 ://bikeparty.ca for further info & we look forward to riding with you!
LOCATION:Multiple Venues
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/1st-bike-party-toronto-of-2026-the-june-
 edition-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
