 7e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Kids’ Tote Bag Painting & Charm Art Workshop in Scarborough\
 nLooking for a fun and creative kids’ art workshop in Scarborough? Join 
 us at Fresh Paint Studio for our Kids’ Tote Bag Painting & Charm Art Wor
 kshop\, a hands-on creative experience designed for young artists who love
  colour\, creativity and design.\nThis beginner-friendly workshop is perfe
 ct for families in Scarborough\, Toronto\, East York\, Pickering\, Markham
 \, and the surrounding GTA who are looking for an artistic weekend activit
 y for kids ages 6+.\nDuring this one-hour workshop\, children will paint a
 nd personalize their very own tote bag using fabric paints\, stencils\, an
 d playful charms that will be glued onto their bags. Each child will have 
 the chance to create a one-of-a-kind tote bag that reflects their personal
 ity\, creativity\, and unique sense of style.\nOur experienced Fresh Paint
  Studio instructors will guide kids step-by-step while still giving them t
 he freedom to explore their own creative ideas. No experience is necessary
  — just bring your imagination and get ready to create.\nAll materials a
 re provided\, including tote bags\, fabric paints\, stencils\, charms\, an
 d smocks.\nEvent Snapshot\nWorkshop: Kids’ Tote Bag Painting & Charm Art
  Workshop\nDate: Saturday\, June 20\, 2026\nTime: 11:30am-12:30pm\nCost: $
 20 per child\nAges: 6+\nLocation: 2229 Kingston Rd. Unit A - Fresh Paint S
 tudio Scarborough Location\nIncludes: Tote bag\, fabric paints\, stencils\
 , charms\, smocks.\nWhat Kids Will Create\nEach child will design and deco
 rate their own custom tote bag using fabric paints\, stencils\, and fun ch
 arm embellishments. Every tote bag will be different\, expressive\, and re
 ady to take home at the end of the workshop.\nThis is a wonderful opportun
 ity for kids to create something useful\, colourful\, and completely their
  own.\nWhy Parents Will Love It\nThis Scarborough kids’ art workshop is 
 a fun\, screen-free creative activity where children can build confidence\
 , practice self-expression\, and enjoy a fun experience in a warm studio e
 nvironment.\nIt is also a great weekend activity for families looking for 
 affordable things to do with kids in Scarborough or Toronto.\nBooking & Po
 licies\nSpaces are limited. Click Register Now to reserve your child’s s
 pot.\nHave more questions? Email info@freshpaintstudio.ca or call 647-927-
 0764.\nBookings are non-refundable but transferable to another workshop wi
 th 48 hours’ notice.\nMore Creative Options for Kids\nFind out more abou
 t our fun kids painting parties and Creative Kids Summer Camp experience.
