 0e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:On June 20th\, we’re doing something we’ve never done befo
 re.\nWe’re bringing back voices from across all 20 issues. The writers\,
  artists\, and storytellers who have helped shape QT\, for a one night ope
 n mic at Three Dollar Bill. 🎙️\nThis isn’t just a celebration. It
 ’s a reminder of what’s possible when queer artists are given space to
  be seen and heard.\nQT exists because of community. And to keep showcasin
 g incredible queer art\, especially emerging and underrepresented voices\,
  we need your continued support.\nIt will be a night filled with performan
 ce\, live drawings\, readings\, raffle and more!\nCome through. Show up. C
 heer loudly. Donate if you can. 💕🌈
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/queer-toronto-magazine-pride-open-mic-fu
 ndraiser-event-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
