DESCRIPTION:We would love for you to join us in welcoming Katie Butler to 
 Gallery 1888 and celebrating the opening of this exhibition.\nDeveloped ov
 er the past five years\, RE[d]ACTIVE brings together paintings and persona
 l journals that examine memory\, vulnerability\, and the ways our understa
 nding of past experiences evolves over time. On opening night\, the journa
 ls will be presented in their original form before becoming progressively 
 redacted throughout the exhibition\, reflecting how time reshapes our rela
 tionship to difficult memories and what we choose to carry forward.\nOpeni
 ng Reception\nSaturday\, June 20\, 2026\n4:00 PM – 6:00 PM\nGallery 1888
