BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fathers Day Baby Art Workshop in Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260621T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260621T120000
UID:blogto-236003@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/03/original_imagecf868b63-694f-4549-a408-c376451e3d
 0a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Father’s Day Baby Art Workshop in Toronto\nA Creative Mornin
 g for Dads and Babies\nLooking for a meaningful way to celebrate Father’
 s Day with your little one in Toronto?\nJoin us at Fresh Paint Studio + Ca
 fe for a special Father’s Day Baby Art Workshop\, a warm and welcoming c
 reative session designed for parents\, babies\, and little ones to enjoy t
 ogether in Scarborough. This is more than an art workshop — it is a chan
 ce for dads to enjoy some connection and make beautiful keepsake artwork w
 ith their babies just in time to celebrate Father’s Day.\nIn this specia
 l session\, babies will explore colour\, texture\, and movement using non-
 toxic vegetable- and fruit-based paints\, along with sponges\, stamps\, an
 d playful mark-making tools. With your help\, your baby will add adorable 
 handprint and footprints to their masterpieces while enjoying a fun\, sens
 ory-rich creative experience.\nIt is the perfect way to slow down\, make m
 emories\, and create something heartfelt that can be treasured for years t
 o come — whether for yourself\, for baby\, or as a meaningful Father’s
  Day gift for a grandfather or loved one.\nWhat Babies Will Create\nBabies
  can create:\nTwo mini 8 x 10 canvases\nThese keepsake paintings are perfe
 ct for preserving those tiny hands and feet in a way that feels personal\,
  creative\, and full of love.\nPersonalization Option\nWant to make your b
 aby’s artwork even more special?\nWe can pre-apply your baby’s first i
 nitial or first and last initial in vinyl lettering to one or two canvases
  in advance. Your baby will then paint the canvas and once we remove the v
 inyl stickers\, the initials will still be visible.\nPlease email your bab
 y’s initial(s) at least three days before the session to:\ninfo@freshpai
 ntstudio.ca\nWorkshop Details\nFather’s Day Baby Art Workshop\nDate: Jun
 e 21\nTime: 11:00 am - 12:00 pm\nCost: $40 + HST\nWhy Dads Will Love This 
 Workshop\nA beautiful Father’s Day season outing with baby\nA fun\, baby
 -friendly sensory art experience\nMeaningful keepsake artwork to cherish\n
 A relaxed and welcoming studio environment\nA special way to celebrate fat
 herhood through creativity\nImportant Notes\nWe will be using natural vegg
 ie-and fruit-based paint made with flour and natural dyes from ingredients
  such as blueberries\, carrots\, beets\, and spinach\, along with food col
 ouring to intensify the colours.\nThis is a messy workshop — and that is
  part of the fun!\nPlease dress for mess\nWe recommend bringing:\nA change
  of clothes for baby\nA towel\nAnything your little one may need after cle
 an-up\nAdult smocks are available for caregivers.\nStroller Note\nPlease n
 ote that studio space for strollers is limited. If possible\, we recommend
  bringing a baby carrier or a small compact stroller to help us keep the s
 pace comfortable for everyone.\nCelebrate Fatherhood in a Meaningful Way\n
 Father’s Day is not only about gifts — it is about moments. This works
 hop offers a beautiful opportunity to celebrate the early days of fatherho
 od and create a keepsake that captures this season in such a special way i
 n Toronto.\nCome make a mess\, make memories\, and create something beauti
 ful with your baby.\nSpaces are limited. Register today.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/fathers-day-baby-art-workshop-in-toronto
 -toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
