 24.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Experience global cultures\, food & live performances at Toron
 to’s vibrant multicultural festival – free entry!\n🌍 Experience the
  World in One Place\nStep into a vibrant celebration of culture\, communit
 y\, and connection at Global Fest Canada — Toronto’s multicultural fes
