 ry\, masked\, creative & nerdy\nCost: [FREE/PRICE]\nDress Code: MASKED!\nC
 raft Your Own Variant Cover!\nCALLING ALL TRANS & SAPPHIC COMIC NERDS!\nDo
 n your mask and join us at HQ (Three Dollar Bill) on June 21st for a low-s
 ensory creative night! We're diving deep into comic book culture with a co
 llage-making session.\nDetails:\nMasked Collage Workshop - Comics Theme - 
