 o GET IT\, find people who know their Deadpool variants from their Spider-
 Verse issues\, and vibe with creative queers in a chill\, low-sensory envi
 ronment.\nAll skill levels welcome. No gatekeeping allowed. Art supplies &
  comics provided but bring your own favorites to sacrifice to the collage 
 gods!\n******* Low sensory environment: Softer lighting\, quieter space fo
 r focused creating\, masks to keep everyone safe! The space isn't wheelcha
 ir accessible\, No ASL for this event *******
