 les retreat in the beautiful countryside outside Tottenham\, Ontario.\nDes
 igned for couples longing to slow down\, reconnect\, and deepen intimacy i
 n a grounded and meaningful way\, this immersive experience weaves togethe
 r somatic practices\, conscious communication\, nervous system awareness\,
  breath\, embodiment\, and relational presence.\nThis is not simply about 
 learning communication tools.\nIt’s about experiencing what becomes poss
 ible when you stay connected to yourself while opening more deeply to each
  other.\nTogether we’ll explore:\nEmotional responsibility in relationsh
 ip\nNervous system regulation & co-regulation\nSomatic connection practice
 s\nEmbodied communication\nBreath\, presence\, intimacy\, and relational a
 ttunement\nThis retreat is intentionally intimate — limited to only 4 co
 uples — allowing for depth\, safety\, personalized attention\, and meani
 ngful connection.\nLight refreshments\, herbal teas\, and a curated grazin
 g table will be provided. Couples are welcome to bring their own lunch.\n
