SUMMARY:MY HOUSE JUNCTION JAZZ FEST 2026: JORDANA TALSKY
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260622T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260622T220000
UID:blogto-236280@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/09/original_image4dd01e15-0d8a-48b8-ba83-21e95ee5e8
 c8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:MY HOUSE JUNCTION JAZZ FEST 2026: JORDANA TALSKY\nAll Fest Tic
 kets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n@ My HOUSE\, 2882 Dundas St. West\, T
 oronto\, 416-604-4555\nJune 22 to 28 -- 7 days of the nation's best jazz m
 usicians in the Junction's own My HOUSE!\nFrom Press Release:\nToronto's M
 y HOUSE in the Junction live music venue & restaurant has again teamed up 
 with Brooklyn\, NY's Browntasauras Records -- who has a studio in the Junc
 tion -- to bring you some of the best jazz in the country from June 22 to 
 28. This year again features Artist-In-Residence BROWNMAN ALI as the fest'
 s Artistic Director\, up from Brooklyn\, NY. This 10x Global Music Award w
 inner\, 12x JUNO Award nominee & GRAMMY Award long-lister will be on stage
  every night during the festival as either a sideman or a leader\, and has
  hand-picked all the top-tier musicians & award-winning ensembles involved
  in the 2nd annual My HOUSE Junction Jazz Fest featuring classic jazz\, mo
 dern jazz\, latin-jazz\, electric-jazz and more! Come to My HOUSE in the J
 unction this June 22 to 28 for 7 nights of an unforgettable jazz experienc
 e!\n----\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n----\nFEST SCHE
 DULE AT-A-GLANCE -->\nMon-Jun-22\, 7pm: JORDANA TALSKY: LIVE LOOPING\nTue-
 Jun-23\, 7pm: JACOB WUTZKE TRIO\nWed-Jun-24\, 7pm: NICK MACLEAN 4-TET play
  HERBIE HANCOCK\nThr-Jun-25\, 7pm: ARECIBO - Proyecto Blanquito\nFri-Jun-2
 6\, 8pm: BROWNMAN ELECTRYC TRIO\nSat-Jun-27\, 8pm: GENEVIEVE MARENTETTE's 
 FLUX-STATE\nSun-Jun-28\, 4pm: MILES DAVIS: The PRESTIGE YEARS\n----\nAll F
 est Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n----\nMon-Jun-22\, 7:00pm\, $1
 5 adv / $20 door\nJORDANA TALSKY - LIVE LOOPING\nModern vocal-jazz looping
 \nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/1990304468242\nJordana Talsky is an award wi
 nning singer/songwriter (semi-finalist at the Sarah Vaughn International V
 ocal Jazz Competition) and vocal looper who crafts intricate soundscapes u
 sing only her voice and body\, live-looped through a Roland Boss RC505. He
 r EP Zahava -- Hebrew for "golden" and her middle name -- showcases this i
 nnovative approach\, layering harmonies\, rhythms\, and melodies without p
 re-recorded parts. Her vocal loop track\, “RUN\,” was selected as a fi
 nalist in Canada’s CBC Searchlight Contest.\n:: Jordan Talsky - vocals &
  loops\n:: Scott Metcalfe - piano\nw/ special guest Brownman Ali - trumpet
 \nwww.JordanaTalsky.com
