BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:In Conversation: Moira Welsh & Kathleen Wynne
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260623T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260623T200000
UID:blogto-236277@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/09/original_image21b0108c-173f-47ae-9f80-efceba0fc5
 b6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Event type: All Ages\nJoin Moira Welsh in conversation with Ka
 thleen Wynne to discuss her recent book The Astonishing Lives of Older Wom
 en: How to Create Pleasure Over Peril in Peak Longevity.\nEvent Guidelines
 :\nThis is a ticketed event\nGeneral Admission + Book includes access to t
 he event space\, the signing line and one copy of The Astonishing Lives of
  Older Women\nCandid photography only\n\nAbout the Book:\nThe Astonishing 
 Lives of Older Women offers both cautionary tales from courageous women an
 d practical financial insights\, empowering women to navigate the challeng
 es of career decisions\, family responsibilities\, and long-term financial
  planning with greater awareness and confidence.\nA powerful exploration o
 f the financial realities women face as they age — and the resilience\, 
 reinvention\, and relationships that sustain them.\nWomen are living longe
 r than ever\, but for many\, those extra years come with financial uncerta
 inty. This book tells the stories of women who\, after raising children\, 
 managing households\, and working in fulfilling careers\, find themselves 
 now alone and surviving on the edge.\nA national housing crisis hits harde
 r when the gender pension gap leaves women with significantly less retirem
 ent income than men\, but this crisis isn’t inevitable. A CEO\, a legal 
 scholar\, and a feminist economist offer essential advice on careers\, pen
 sions\, and relationships\, while the voice of a young writer from Lainey 
 Gossip reveals why financial independence is non-negotiable.\nThis book lo
 oks at how women can embrace this new longevity with strength and purpose.
  A wake-up call for women of all ages\, it is an inspiring testament to th
 e lasting social and economic contributions of women.\nThe astonishing liv
 es of older women are not defined by money or men. They are defined by res
 ilience\, purpose\, desire\, and the unbreakable bonds of female friendshi
 p.
LOCATION:Indigo Sherway Gardens
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/in-conversation-moira-welsh-kathleen-wyn
 ne-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
