 , Toronto\, 416-604-4555\nJune 22 to 28 -- 7 days of the nation's best jaz
 z musicians in the Junction's own My HOUSE!\nFrom Press Release:\nToronto'
 s My HOUSE in the Junction live music venue & restaurant has again teamed 
 up with Brooklyn\, NY's Browntasauras Records -- who has a studio in the J
 unction -- to bring you some of the best jazz in the country from June 22 
