 f1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:We're back the second edition of Open Ended and this month\, w
 e're turning the gossip up a notch!\nCalling all oversharers & gossip girl
 s! 🚨\nA drinks night to take your silly hot takes\, pet peeves\, and ir
 rational beef out of the group chat. 👀🍷\nOpen Ended is back and this
  time with our iconic Hateration theme. Think less “toxic negativity” 
 and more playful honesty\, cultural commentary\, and collective venting in
  a room full of people who just get it. We’re creating space to laugh\, 
 unpack modern life\, overshare a little\, and connect through the things w
 e secretly all think.\nExpect laughs\, gasps\, and lots of WTF moments ove
 r a curated night of conversation\, drinks\, and connection.\nCome ready t
 o discuss:\n• your most irrational pet peeves\n• things that are objec
 tively overrated\n• niche dating grievances\n• internet discourse fati
 gue\n• wellness culture chaos\n• and all the other unserious-serious t
 houghts living rent free in your head\nLimited spots available.
