SUMMARY:Parkside Live Presents: Mamawin towin: A Metis Kitchen Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260624T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260624T200000
UID:blogto-236384@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/10/original_imagebace3f61-71c1-43a0-a5e4-01daf6d167
 d8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A Métis Kitchen Party where music\, stories\, and community c
 ome together\nSponsored by: Friends of Parkside Live\nBring your blanket a
 nd lawnchairs for a magical evening of music in the garden of Redeemer Lut
 heran Church. This FREE/PAY-WHAT-YOU-CAN. show supports the Bloor by the P
 ark Community Pantry.\nCo-led by celebrated Métis fiddler Alyssa Katrine 
 and JUNO-nominated and CFMA Award–winning Métis singer-songwriter Amand
 a Rheaume\, Mâmawin’towin brings together an exceptional acoustic ensem
 ble rooted in Métis musical tradition. The group has toured international
 ly\, most recently performing at World Expo 2025 in Osaka\, Japan\, as wel
 l as in Australia\, sharing Métis music with global audiences.\nJoined by
  acclaimed multi-instrumentalists Danton Delbaere-Sawchuk and Kyler Tapsco
 tt\, the ensemble blends driving Métis fiddle tunes\, rich vocal harmonie
 s\, and powerful storytelling inspired by Métis history and community.\nD
 rawing on the warmth and spirit of a Métis kitchen party\, their performa
 nces celebrate resilience\, kinship\, and the enduring vitality of Métis 
 music.\nPerformers:\nAlyssa Katrine — fiddle\, vocals\nAmanda Rheaume 
 — vocals\, guitar\nDanton Delbaere-Sawchuk — cello\, guitar\, vocals\n
 Kyler Tapscott — guitar\, vocals
LOCATION:Redeemer Lutheran Church
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/parkside-live-presents-mamawin-towin-a-m
 etis-kitchen-party-toronto/
