 s a curated selection of films representing Canada's rich cultural mosaic\
 , paired with a vibrant Festival Village featuring music\, dance\, and exp
 eriential activations. Located in the heart of Toronto\, this unique cinem
 atic experience seamlessly connects audiences under the stars with multicu
 ltural visual storytelling\, international filmmaking talent\, and a dynam
 ic exploration of community identity.\nTickets:\nIndividual tickets are av
 ailable starting at $22 per screening. Early Bird 4-Ticket or 6-Ticket bun
 dles offer a 30% discount.\n*Every individual and package ticket for Disti
 llery District screenings includes a curated food and beverage tasting exp
 erience featuring partner stations (such as Masi Prosecco\, Birra Moretti\
 , or a Campari cocktail\, Lavazza coffee\, and bites from Ferrero\, Barill
 a\, and Eataly). Online-only streaming passes (ICFF at Home) are available
  for $35.\nhttps://icff.ca/
