 \, Toronto\, 416-604-4555\nJune 22 to 28 -- 7 days of the nation's best ja
 zz musicians in the Junction's own My HOUSE!\nFrom Press Release:\nToronto
 's My HOUSE in the Junction live music venue & restaurant has again teamed
  up with Brooklyn\, NY's Browntasauras Records -- who has a studio in the 
 Junction -- to bring you some of the best jazz in the country from June 22
  to 28. This year again features Artist-In-Residence BROWNMAN ALI as the f
 est's Artistic Director\, up from Brooklyn\, NY. This 10x Global Music Awa
 rd winner\, 12x JUNO Award nominee & GRAMMY Award long-lister will be on s
 tage every night during the festival as either a sideman or a leader\, and
  has hand-picked all the top-tier musicians & award-winning ensembles invo
 lved in the 2nd annual My HOUSE Junction Jazz Fest featuring classic jazz\
 , modern jazz\, latin-jazz\, electric-jazz and more! Come to My HOUSE in t
 he Junction this June 22 to 28 for 7 nights of an unforgettable jazz exper
 ience!\n----\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n----\nFEST 
