 ll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n----\nThr-Jun-25\, 7:00pm\
 , $20 adv / $30 door\nARECBIO - Proyecto Blanquito\nLatin-jazz\nhttps://ww
 w.eventbrite.ca/e/1990305113171\nThis exciting Latin-jazz outfit delves de
 eply into both Cuban and Brazilian modern jazz traditions\, modeled after 
