 \, ICFF is bringing the energy of the beautiful game to the heart of the D
 istillery District with a celebration of soccer\, cinema\, and culture. Ki
 cking off on June 25\, the Distillery District will transform into a cinem
 a and fun event under the stars! As part of the official selection of movi
 es\, ICFF presents its 'Soccer Series' showcasing a lineup of new releases
  and fan-favourite classics\, alongside special guests and champions of th
 e game.\nFeaturing beloved films like "Bend It Like Beckham" and "Next Goa
 l Wins"\, the series celebrates soccer's global cultural impact while buil
 ding anticipation for the arrival of the World Cup 2026 in Toronto.\nIndiv
 idual tickets are available starting at $22 per screening. Early Bird 4-Ti
 cket or 6-Ticket bundles offer a 30% discount.\nEvery individual and packa
 ge ticket for Distillery District screenings includes a curated food and b
 everage tasting experience featuring partner stations (such as Masi Prosec
 co\, Birra Moretti\, or a Campari cocktail\, Lavazza coffee\, and bites fr
 om Ferrero\, Barilla\, and Eataly). Online-only streaming passes (ICFF at 
 Home) are available for $35.
