 b1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Denielle Bassels performs at DROM Taberna on June 26\, 2026 at
  8 PM.\nJuno-nominated\, her music lives in a space that is smoky\, alive\
 , raw\, and cinematic. Dynamic\, refreshing songwriting sits at the centre
  of her work\, contemporary\, familiar\, and whimsical in equal measure. D
 enielle Bassels’ silky voice can pull at your heartstrings or make you w
 ant to lose yourself.\nA night of live music in one of Toronto’s most vi
 brant rooms.\nDoors: 7 PM\nShow: 8 PM\nTickets: NO COVER\nBassels brings h
 er dynamic and smokey Sextet to Drom Taberna playing her latest works from
  her acclaimed 2025 album It Goes Like This.\nAs WholeNote Magazine observ
 es\, Bassels is “one of the most intriguing jazz/pop singer-songwriters 
 on the current scene\,” a reflection of an artist who builds her work no
 t around a single voice\, but around the space between many.\nBassels does
  not smooth over contradiction. She sharpens it\, and lets it sing.
