 s fill quickly. Spots are limited.)\nGiveaways + Raffles\n• Win a FREE 4
 -Week Pottery Course\n• Fun prizes throughout the day\nFood\, Drinks & T
 reats\n• Enjoy local delicious bites and refreshing drinks for purchase\
 nDrop-In Creative Activities (Paid Drop-in Workshops)\n• Paint Your Own 
 Pottery Workshop\n• Mosaic Workshops\n(No booking needed — pay when yo
 u arrive and join anytime)\nSalsa Dancing & Music\n• Good energy all day
  with music and dancing (Celebrating our Latin culture)\nOne-Day-Only Offe
 r\n• Book a class during the event and receive a FREE pottery piece\nA C
 elebration of 10 Years\nFor the past 10 years\, Clay With Me has been a sp
 ace for creativity\, connection\, and trying something new. This event is 
 our way of celebrating the community that made it all possible.\nCome Earl
 y\nFree wheel spots are limited and fill up fast. Purchase raffles before 
 they run out!\nBring your friends\, family\, or come solo—no experience 
 needed.\nJust show up and join the celebration. Follow us on IG @claywithm
 e for more information and updates.\nA Little Bit of Our Story:\nClay With
  Me was born from a simple idea: creativity has the power to connect us.\n
 In 2010\, our founder Gabby moved to Toronto to start a new chapter. As sh
 e built her life in a new city\, she found belonging in a close-knit commu
 nity of mothers—women who supported one another\, shared their time\, an
 d created a sense of home together.\nIt was through this community that cl
 ay first entered the picture. Gabby began setting up small clay sessions i
 n her home\, using it as a way to keep the kids engaged hands busy\, creat
 ivity flowing. What started as a simple activity quickly grew into somethi
 ng more\, and she opened her kitchen studio to more families.\nFrom those 
 early days around a kitchen table\, Clay With Me has grown into a space wh
 ere thousands of people have come to slow down\, create\, and connect.\nTh
 is anniversary is more than a milestone\, it’s a celebration of the comm
 unity that shaped us.
LOCATION:Clay with Me
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/clay-with-me-10-year-anniversary-party-i
 n-toronto-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:clean breaks monthly residency
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T230000
UID:blogto-235995@blogto.com
