BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Habibi and Friends - Stand Up Comedy Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T213000
UID:blogto-236420@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/11/original_image66098d7c-9f30-4c08-9b79-d4c640c6a2
 93.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Interactive stand-up hosted by Moe Ismail. Crowd work\, audien
 ce suggestions\, new bits\, and surprise guest comedians. Every show is di
 fferent\nHabibi and Friends is a stand-up comedy show where anything can h
 appen.\nHosted by Toronto comedian Moe Ismail\, the show features some of 
 the best comedians in the country doing crowd work\, riffing with the audi
 ence\, and taking topic suggestions live on stage. Every show ends up goin
 g in a completely different direction depending on who’s in the room and
  what gets thrown at the comics.\nThe lineup will consist of surprise gues
 t comedians—some of the best in the country—who drop in unannounced. W
 e don’t release the lineup ahead of time\, so the only way to find out w
 ho’s on the show is to be in the room.\nIt’s loose\, unpredictable\, a
 nd a lot more interactive than a typical stand-up show.\nAlong the way\, c
 omedians will also be trying out some of their newest material — jokes a
 nd ideas they’re working on before they make their way into bigger sets\
 , tours\, or specials.\nExpect quick thinking\, off-the-cuff moments\, and
  the kind of comedy that only happens when comics are reacting in real tim
 e.\nCome hang out\, grab some of the best food and drinks\, and watch some
  of the country’s best comedians figure it out live!
LOCATION:Utopia Cafe & Grill
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/habibi-and-friends-stand-up-comedy-show-
 toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
