 gto.com/events/2026/06/09/original_image1bc326ae-961f-434e-8edd-528c4dc9c4
 2f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:MY HOUSE JUNCTION JAZZ FEST 2026: MILES DAVIS - PRESTIGE YEARS
  feat. Brownman Ali\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrite.com/cc/4844128\n@ My
  HOUSE\, 2882 Dundas St. West\, Toronto\, 416-604-4555\nJune 22 to 28 -- 7
  days of the nation's best jazz musicians in the Junction's own My HOUSE!\
 nFrom Press Release:\nToronto's My HOUSE in the Junction live music venue 
 & restaurant has again teamed up with Brooklyn\, NY's Browntasauras Record
 s -- who has a studio in the Junction -- to bring you some of the best jaz
 z in the country from June 22 to 28. This year again features Artist-In-Re
 sidence BROWNMAN ALI as the fest's Artistic Director\, up from Brooklyn\, 
 NY. This 10x Global Music Award winner\, 12x JUNO Award nominee & GRAMMY A
 ward long-lister will be on stage every night during the festival as eithe
 r a sideman or a leader\, and has hand-picked all the top-tier musicians &
  award-winning ensembles involved in the 2nd annual My HOUSE Junction Jazz
  Fest featuring classic jazz\, modern jazz\, latin-jazz\, electric-jazz an
 d more! Come to My HOUSE in the Junction this June 22 to 28 for 7 nights o
 f an unforgettable jazz experience!\n----\nAll Fest Tickets: www.eventbrit
 e.com/cc/4844128\n----\nFEST SCHEDULE AT-A-GLANCE -->\nMon-Jun-22\, 7pm: J
