BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SocialSip: An 1867 Canada Day Murder Mystery & Networking Experien
 ce
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T200000
UID:blogto-236389@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/10/original_imagedcc09ab2-d12c-4bc4-b5d1-58a0395208
 b6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Overview\nStep into 1867 for a night of cocktails\, clues\, an
 d connection at Toronto’s most immersive Canada Day murder mystery netwo
 rking experience.\n📍 EVENT DETAILS\n📅 Sunday\, June 28\, 2026\n⏰ 5
 :00 PM – 8:00 PM\n📍 Society Clubhouse\n🔞 19+ Event\n⚠ IMPORTANT 
 NOTES\nLimited capacity event\nTickets are non-refundable but transferable
 \nArrive on time for the full experience\n🇨🇦 ABOUT THE EVENT\nConfed
 eration has just begun… but as celebrations erupt across the new country
 \, a shocking murder disrupts the evening.\nOn June 28\, guests are invite
 d to step into an immersive 1867-inspired Canada Day experience filled wit
 h mystery\, networking\, cocktails\, and interactive gameplay.\nAs fellow 
 detectives for the night\, attendees will:🔎 uncover clues🥂 mingle wi
 th fellow detectives🕯 interrogate suspects🤝 make new connections🎭
  and work together to solve the mystery before the night ends\nWhether you
  attend solo or with friends\, this experience is designed to make meeting
  new people feel natural\, interactive\, and unforgettable.\n🔎 MURDER M
 YSTERY STORYLINE\nThe date is July 1\, 1867. Canada has just officially be
 come a nation.\nAt a grand mansion on the outskirts of the city\, the elit
 e gathered for an exclusive Confederation celebration filled with lavish c
 ocktails\, lively conversation\, and extravagant festivities.\nBut the cel
 ebration comes to a sudden halt.\nA scream cuts through the room.\nThe eve
 ning's esteemed host was found dead. Gasps and whispers spread through the
  crowd. This was no accident.\nThe investigation has begun and you have be
 en called in to help crack the case.\nHere at the Society Clubhouse\, our 
 team has meticulously created a crime scene modelled after the actual scen
 e discovered at the mansion that night. Every clue\, every detail has been
  carefully laid out before you.\nNow\, Detectives\, we need your help.\nIn
 terrogate suspects. Uncover hidden motives. Follow the clues.\nCan you sol
 ve the mystery before the killer slips away?\n✨ WHAT TO EXPECT\n🔍 Int
 eractive Murder Mystery Experience\nEach guest becomes a detective for the
  night — inspecting a live crime scene\, interrogating suspects from the
  story\, uncovering clues\, and working together to solve the murder befor
 e the night ends.\n🍸 Cocktails & Light Bites\nEnjoy a full bar and caf
 é at the front of the venue alongside music and immersive decor inspired 
 by 1867 Canada.\n🤝 Networking Made Easy\nNot your average boring networ
 king event — this is a fun\, immersive social experience designed to hel
 p you make meaningful connections and meet new people naturally throughout
  the night.\n🎭 1867 Canada Day Theme\nExpect vintage-inspired attire\, 
 Confederation-era ambiance\, and immersive storytelling woven throughout t
 he evening.\n📸 Themed Photo Opportunities\nCapture the moment with phot
 os at our themed photobooth and interactive video testimony phone provided
  by Snap N' Speak\n👀 WHO SHOULD ATTEND?\nPerfect for:\nyoung profession
 als\ncreatives & entrepreneurs\ncompetitive friend groups\nsolo attendees\
 ncompetitive couples\nmystery lovers\nanyone tired of traditional networki
 ng events and who loves a good problem-solving mystery\n👗 DRESS CODE\n1
 867-Inspired Cocktail or Detective Attire Encouraged\nThink:\nvintage eleg
 ance\nold-money aesthetics\nwaistcoats & corsets\npearls\, gloves\, suits\
 , and formalwear\nblack trench coats & tailored suits\nelevated cocktail a
 ttire\n📌 Pinterest inspiration board: https://pin.it/2uNLIi7ef\n(This a
 ttire is highly encouraged for the full immersive experience.)\n🎟 YOUR 
 TICKET INCLUDES\nEntry to the event\n2-hour interactive murder mystery exp
 erience\n1-hour casual networking experience\nAccess to the full venue bar
  & cafe\nFully immersive and interactive photobooth and video testimony ph
 one experience\n🥂 ABOUT SOCIALSIP\nSocialSip curates unique social expe
 riences that make meeting people feel easy\, natural\, engaging\, and memo
 rable.\nBy blending immersive entertainment with intentional networking\, 
 our events are designed to help people connect beyond traditional mixers a
 nd nightlife.\n🔍 ABOUT IMMERSIVE GAME CLUB\nImmersive Game Club is on a
  mission to make extraordinary experiences accessible to everyone. We come
  to you - bringing fully hosted mysteries\, role-playing adventures and es
 cape room experiences right to your doorstep. Perfect for birthdays\, corp
 orate events or night out with friends. Our events are designed to pull yo
 u out of the everyday and into a world of mystery\, strategy and storytell
 ing. We also run regular public events\, so there's always a new adventure
  around the corner.\n🎟 SECURE YOUR SPOT\nOne night. One mystery. Solve 
 it together.Limited tickets available — secure yours now.
LOCATION:Society Clubhouse
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/socialsip-an-1867-canada-day-murder-myst
 ery-networking-experience-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
