BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Brothers Investigation - Presented by the ICFF Festival at the
  Distillery District
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260628T224500
UID:blogto-236295@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/09/original_image3d52e2be-7649-47d8-94cb-0847329cd2
 f6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:It’s a simple case… how hard can it be?\nJoin ICFF for a s
 pecial screening of Kardeşler Araştırma (The Brothers Investigation)\, 
 a drama with mystery\, family\, and self-discovery.\nWhen two estranged br
 others find themselves drawn back into each other’s lives\, a mysterious
  investigation forces them to confront long-buried secrets\, unresolved te
 nsions\, and the complicated bond they share. As they follow a trail of cl
 ues that stretches far beyond what they expected\, the brothers are pushed
  into a journey that challenges their perceptions of family\, loyalty\, an
 d themselves.\nFilled with suspense and moments of unexpected humour\, The
  Brothers Investigation shows the ties that connect us even when life pull
 s us apart.\nMore than a search for answers\, this is a journey into the h
 eart of family where every discovery brings the brothers closer to underst
 anding the past and each other.\nDon’t miss this moving film that proves
  some mysteries are not about what happened\, but about the people we beco
 me while searching for the truth.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-brothers-investigation-presented-by-
 the-icff-festival-at-the-distillery-district-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
