BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Many Happy Returns - Toronto Fringe '26 Immersive Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T191500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T204500
UID:blogto-236079@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/04/original_imageab677b60-e409-41d4-8370-e0c8500413
 d4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:You have been selected for a mission of utmost importance: you
  will be transported back in time to retrieve 10 critical historical artif
 acts. For your mission\, we have managed to sneak you onto an exclusive gu
 est list to attend a New Year’s Eve party\, December 31\, 1926. Should s
 uccess evade you\, you will find yourself trapped in a loop\, reliving the
  party again and again. You will have one hour to accomplish your mission.
  Are you ready to take on this race against the clock?\nWork together\, ge
 t to know The People from the Past\; find out their desires\, help them ac
 hieve their goals\, and they will help you achieve yours! Learn\, plan\, a
 nd manipulate the events of the party to retrieve the 10 artifacts before 
 your time travel abilities wear off! Teamwork will be key to achieve all o
 f your goals\, as there will be many schemes afoot.\nEvery show is entirel
 y different based on your choices and what plots you decide to be part of\
 , so come back and see us again!  We have new performers\, new characters\
 , and new hijinks just for you\, and we'd love for you to join us!\n*As th
 is is\, of course\, a New Year’s Eve party\, 1926\, please do dress to i
 mpress!\n*30-minute cocktail reception to meet co-operatives\, 60-minute c
 aper!\n*19+\nReviews & Accolades:\n*Winner - No Proscenium’s “Immie”
  Audience Award for Outstanding Immersive Work (2025)\n*From the award-win
 ning director of "Meet Cute" (Best of Fringe) and creator of Sorry 'Bout T
 hat. (Fringe Top 5)\n*Sold-out audiences across Toronto!\n*Immersive and i
 nteractive - your decisions create the outcome of the adventure!\n*Make ne
 w friends!\n*Come back and join us again to experience new storylines - ev
 ery visit is unique!\n"I had such an amazing time at this production... Th
 ese performers are masterful... If you're feeling like a fun and glamourou
 s night out\, Many Happy Returns is the show for you!..."You definitely do
 n't want to miss out on Many Happy Returns."\n-Janine Marley\, A View from
  the Box\n"The brilliance of Many Happy Returns lies in the many branches 
 of the story... A genuine sense of camaraderie as we unlocked pieces of th
 e puzzle... a time loop I'd happily experience over and over and over agai
 n."\n-Katrina Lat\, Toronto Curator\n"Better than an escape room!"\n-Audie
 nce Testimonial\nDates/Times (please note all times are in p.m.)\n*All tim
 es in p.m.\nDate                Cocktails/Briefing      Heist\nJune 30    
        7:15                             7:45\nJuly 1               4      
                             4:30\nJuly 2               10                 
                10:30\nJuly 5               9                              
     9:30\nJuly 6               7:15                             7:45\nJuly
  7               7:15                             7:45\nJuly 9            
    6:45                             7:15\nJuly 12             2           
                        2:30
LOCATION:Society Clubhouse
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/many-happy-returns-toronto-fringe-26-imm
 ersive-show-toronto/
