 the energy\, the sass\, and the chaos every Tuesday night at one of Toront
 o's most vibrant spots.\nTHE GAME\n10 pop culture categories covering the 
 best in celeb drama\, film\, TV\, music\, and everything in between\nInter
 active lightning rounds mixed throughout — think agility\, wit\, and ver
 y questionable decision-making — all worth BONUS points\nA final wager q
 uestion that can flip the entire leaderboard in one move\nWHO SHOULD ATTEN
 D Think trivia isn't your thing? PERFECT. That's exactly why you're here.\
 nQE Trivia is not your dusty pub quiz. We flip the script on game night 
 — no brain-busting history facts\, no awkward silences. Just pop culture
  pandemonium\, high BPM energy\, and a crowd that's here to have a genuine
 ly great Tuesday.\nWhether you win or lose\, you'll leave with a story.\n
