 ct a rotating mix of:\n$25 E-Gift Card for Tha Phae Tavern\n1 Hour Private
  Karaoke Room Experience\nTha Phae Tavern merch 🎶\nGRETA 1 Hour Unlimit
 ed Play Cards\nAdditional weekly prizes from rotating sponsors\n🌊 ELECT
 RIC ISLAND SUMMER TICKET GIVEAWAY 🌊 This summer\, QE Trivia is giving a
 way tickets to Electric Island — Toronto's iconic waterfront dance music
  festival. RSVPs through Eventbrite give you automatic entries into our we
 ekly raffle. The more you show up\, the better your chances. Details annou
 nced by the host each night.\nVENUE & TICKET INFO Please arrive by 5:45 PM
  to be seated — game starts promptly at 6:00 PM.\nSold out? Join the wai
 tlist — spots drop last minute more often than you'd think\n$25 minimum 
 spend per person (a couple drinks and a bite — easy)
