BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Soul Food Caribbean Festival  Fire in the Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260701T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260701T230000
UID:blogto-235088@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/15/original_imageedc2c466-bead-4fbf-b232-841ac5859e
 8e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Toronto\, get ready for one of the biggest Caribbean music eve
 nts of the summer.\nSoul Food Caribbean Festival – Fire in the Park retu
 rns on Canada Day featuring the return of legendary reggae and dancehall a
 rtist Capleton\, international hitmaker Gyptian\, and for the first time e
 ver in Toronto\, D'yani.\nExperience a full day of live performances\, Car
 ibbean culture\, food vendors\, music\, entertainment\, DJs\, and special 
 fan experiences including exclusive meet-and-greet opportunities.\nJoin mu
 sic lovers from across Toronto and the GTA for an unforgettable Canada Day
  celebration filled with reggae\, dancehall\, culture\, and positive energ
