 68.jpg
DESCRIPTION:It’s 2026 so the roaring 20s are back! Life is full of spark
 le\, parties\, and depression. Join your charming hostess for an evening o
 f music\, sketch comedy\, and cheeky fun.\nHosted by a vivacious character
  who feels like she just stepped out of a cabaret\, this show dances betwe
 en catchy original songs and larger than life characters. From a F***boy T
 TC streetcar\, to a mother completely unfazed by the ghost in her house\, 
 to musical crowdwork\, By Popular Demand moves effortlessly from smart pol
 itical commentary to big\, outrageous fun. But this isn't a show you passi
 vely sit through. Integrating live interaction and crowdwork\, every perfo
 rmance is different\, blurring the fourth wall until the line between audi
 ence and performer disappears entirely!\nPresented as part of the Toronto 
 Fringe Festival. Tickets available through the Toronto Fringe Website list
 ed below.
