BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DANSE MACABRE by Rhoma Spencer - Toronto Fringe Festival 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T194500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T210000
UID:blogto-236491@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/12/original_image2c0228ef-3e57-46c9-96f3-82c618f277
 63.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Winner of the 2026 Toronto Fringe New Play Contest\, Danse Mac
 abre\, an electrifying Caribbean theatrical work by acclaimed playwright R
 homa Spencer\, arrives at a moment when Canadian stages are ready—if not
  overdue—for a story of this depth and urgency.\nRooted in the vibrant\,
  complex world of Carnival\, Danse Macabre goes beyond spectacle to explor
 e the powerful intersection of culture\, Queer identity\, and resistance. 
 It offers a bold\, unflinching examination of the history and politics of 
 anti-Black racism\, woven into the lived experience of ‘playing mas.’\
 nThis is theatre that speaks to both heart and history.\nRunning from July
  3rd - July 12th\, at Tarragon Theatre Mainspace\, it's not to be missed!
LOCATION:Tarragon Theatre Mainspace
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/danse-macabre-by-rhoma-spencer-toronto-f
 ringe-festival-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Global Synergy Summit 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T170000
UID:blogto-223965@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2025/09/13/original_imageba0ac8f1-5da0-4aff-a989-f3b43f77ec
 78.jpg
DESCRIPTION:In an era marked by geopolitical disruptions\, economic protec
 tionism\, and unprecedented global events\, small businesses remain the ba
 ckbone of innovation and economic resilience. The Global Synergy Summit 20
 26 emerges as a strategic response to widening economic gaps created by sw
 eeping U.S. tariffs\, international trade realignments\, and the fragmente
 d post-COVID business environment.\nSimultaneously\, the FIFA World Cup 20
 26\, co-hosted in Toronto\, provides a unique cultural backdrop and platfo
 rm for global mingling—showcasing diversity\, cooperation\, and collabor
 ation.\nThis summit seeks to empower small business innovators\, facilitat
 e cross-border collaboration\, and promote resilience in a volatile global
  economic climate.\nAre you ready to elevate your business\, expand your g
 lobal network\, and ignite innovation?\nJoin us at the Global Synergy Summ
 it 2026\, taking place July 3–5\, 2026\, in the vibrant city of Toronto\
 , Ontario\, Canada.\nThis high-impact international summit—organized by 
 ELGON International Solutions Inc.—brings together small business innova
 tors\, entrepreneurs\, investors\, thought leaders\, and change-makers fro
 m around the world under one roof.\nImmerse yourself in the diverse\, worl
 d-class business and cultural atmosphere of Toronto—Canada’s economic 
 powerhouse and global innovation hub.\nWhether you’re a startup founder\
 , seasoned entrepreneur\, policymaker\, or investor\, the Global Synergy S
 ummit 2026 is the place to connect\, learn\, and grow.\nLet’s build brid
 ges\, break barriers\, and create synergy on a global scale.
LOCATION:Homewood Suites & Hampton by Hilton® Toronto Airport Corporate C
 entre.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/global-synergy-summit-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
