DESCRIPTION:Guild Festival Theatre’s 15th summer season launches with a 
 special performance by Nagata Shachu. Join us at the Greek Theatre in Guil
 d Park & Gardens as Scarborough’s renowned taiko group leads an outdoor 
 drum and movement workshop at 6:30pm using authentic Japanese hand-drums. 
 The workshop will be followed by a thunderous and heart-pounding performan
 ce to kick off our summer at the Greek Theatre at 7:00pm.\nThanks to the s
 upport of Arts in the Parks\, this special season launch event is free so 
 there’s no need to purchase a ticket. Simply bring a blanket or cushion 
 and enjoy the show - though of course donations in support of the theatre 
 are always welcome! In case of inclement weather please visit guildfestiva
 ltheatre.ca/seasonlaunch for up to date information.\nGuild Festival Theat
 re’s 2026 Season is presented by ARC Insurance & Financial Services Inc.
