BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dusk Reverie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260705T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260705T210000
UID:blogto-235977@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/03/original_imagef44f7261-fc15-4a33-8fab-56f3299cc1
 28.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Dusk Reverie is a one-night-only immersive experience blending
  live harp music\, guided storytelling\, ritual tea\, and sensory elements
 . Designed to help guests leave lighter than they’ve arrived\, a harpist
  and somatic guide takes guests on a journey as they lie down and listen i
 nside a stunning\, architectural space. Neither a concert\, meditation\, n
 or yoga class\, Dusk Reverie borrows from all worlds to create a deeply ci
 nematic and collective sensory gathering.\nDate: July 5\, 2026 | 6:30 PM 
 – 9:00 PM\nInside the evening\nA historic Toronto space — architectura
 l darkness and a sensory environment designed to feel like stepping into a
 nother world entirely\nA live harpist performing an original score in six 
 movements — not background music\, but the emotional spine of the evenin
 g\, designed to take you somewhere as you lie down and listen\nA ritual te
 a and functional mushroom bar — thoughtfully curated\, designed to ease 
 the transition from the pace of the day\nA guided opening — a liminal pa
 ssage through story\, gentle movement\, and intention as the music takes o
 ver\nA closing ceremony that is collective\, visual and sensory — the pa
 rt guests carry home
LOCATION:Beach United
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/dusk-reverie-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
