BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kids Cookie Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260705T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260705T113000
UID:blogto-235840@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/01/original_image640857bb-ddda-46de-8d43-f98c48370d
 5e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whisk up some summer magic with our Kids' Cookie Club\, a hand
 s-on baking and crafting adventure for kids ages 5 to 12\, set in the hear
 t of our museum village's brand-new outdoor kitchen!\nYour young baker wil
 l mix\, roll\, and bake a fresh batch of cookies from scratch - no nuts\, 
 just sweet fun! From gooey chocolate chip to jam-filled thumbprints\, ever
 y week features a new recipe that's easy\, delicious\, and perfect for lit
 tle hands.\nWhile the cookies bake in our outdoor propane oven\, kids will
  dive into a creative craft - decorating something to take home their crea
 tions in style.\nNote that this program provides entry for 1 adult with ea
 ch child\, this is not a drop-off program. Additional adults require a gen
 eral admission ticket. Each child requires their own registration. Guests 
 are welcome to explore the museum grounds and available exhibits for up to
