 ): Snickerdoodles\nWeek 4 (July 26\, 30): Chock-Full of Crunchies\nWeek 5 
 (August 2\, 6): Jam Thumbprint Cookies\nWeek 6 (August 9\, 13): Chocolate 
 Crinkle Cookies\nWeek 7 (August 16\, 20): Molasses Cookies\nWeek 8: (Augus
 t 23\, 27): Lemon Sugar Cookies
