 hile making new friends and creating cute projects in a supportive\, judgm
 ent-free space where imagination can run wild.\nThere are TWO week-long ca
 mps:\nHand Sewing Camp: Campers will get crafty and very hands-on\, learni
 ng essential hand-sewing skills\, and general crafty magic as they make a 
 mini-quilt\, leather book marks\, hand-dyed socks\, pom-pom flowers\, a we
 aving\, and a DIY varsity shirt.\nMachine Sewing Camp: Campers will learn 
