 nce while making: a headband\, throw pillow\, drawstring backpack and summ
 er shorts!\nBoth camps aim to build confidence and strengthen fine motor s
 kills\, hand-eye coordination\, creativity\, and problem-solving — all w
 hile having loads of summer fun!\nNo experience needed — just bring your
  imagination! 🌈✂️\nSkill Level: No experience necessary!\nClass Siz
