 miere at TCM Classic Film Festival\, we're thrilled to present the long-aw
 aited 4K restoration of this long-unseen classic. The edgy\, true crime-in
 spired 1932 Joan Crawford melodrama has been unavailable to screen for dec
 ades while hung up in copyright disputes. It's the stuff of legend\, from 
