BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FMJ: Foreigner Meets Journey: An Etobicoke Summer Concert for KIP 
 Canada
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260712T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260712T180000
UID:blogto-235631@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/27/original_image29bf1c5d-44e9-4091-ad18-8bf223fcc3
 ec.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Don’t stop believin’ in a great summer afternoon for a gre
 at cause.\nJoin us on Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\, at Franklin Horner Communi
 ty Centre in Etobicoke for a community-based outdoor concert featuring FMJ
 : Foreigner Meets Journey\, a high-energy tribute to two of the biggest cl
 assic rock bands of the 1980s.\nEven if you do not know Foreigner or Journ
 ey by name\, you definitely know the songs. From “Don’t Stop Believin
 ’” and Steve Perry’s unforgettable Journey vocals to Foreigner’s m
 assive ballad “I Want to Know What Love Is\,” this is the kind of musi
 c that fills dance floors\, road trips\, karaoke nights\, weddings\, and c
 lassic rock radio playlists.\nCome early\, grab a beer from a local brewer
 y\, enjoy great food\, and settle in for a fun summer afternoon with frien
 ds\, family\, neighbours\, and fellow music fans.\nThe concert begins at 2
 :00 PM.\nYour ticket also includes a sponsor gift bag valued at $25\, and 
 all proceeds will support KIP Canada\, helping provide back-to-school supp
 lies for children with incarcerated parents and their families.\nBring a l
 awn chair\, bring your best singing voice\, and come be part of an afterno
 on of music\, community\, and giving back.
LOCATION:Franklin Horner Community Centre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/fmj-foreigner-meets-journey-an-etobicoke
 -summer-concert-for-kip-canada-toronto/
