BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AperoChic Bastille Day 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260716T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260716T223000
UID:blogto-236195@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/07/original_image5de3aa32-62d1-4db4-82e6-2fd96eb2c5
 46.jpg
DESCRIPTION:AperoChic Bastille Day is back at Cabana Pool Bar! Join us aro
 und the pool to celebrate France national day !\n🇫🇷 Oh là là\, c'e
 st Bastille Day!\nAn Elegant Summer Celebration by ApéroChic\nJuly 16\, 2
 026 from 6:30pm\nCabana Pool Bar | Toronto Waterfront\nEarly Bird Pricing 
 Available Until June 21\nPre-Sale Only\nJoin ApéroChic as we celebrate Fr
 ance's National Day in one of Toronto's most spectacular summer settings.\
 nThis year\, Bastille Day returns to the iconic Cabana Pool Bar for an ele
 gant waterfront soirée. ApéroChic has exclusively privatized the space s
 urrounding Cabana's signature pool\, creating a unique setting with breath
 taking views of Lake Ontario\, the Toronto Islands\, the Toronto skyline a
 nd a spectacular summer sunset.\nJoin us for an unforgettable evening cele
 brating French heritage\, friendship and the art de vivre.\n⚽ Celebratin
 g the World in Toronto\nAs Toronto welcomes the excitement of the FIFA Wor
 ld Cup\, we invite guests from all backgrounds and nationalities to join t
 he celebration. While we proudly celebrate France's National Day\, we also
  celebrate the international spirit that makes our city so vibrant.\nBring
  your flag! All national flags are welcome as a symbol of friendship\, div
 ersity and the shared passion that brings people together through sport an
 d culture.\n🌅 A Refined Evening by the Water\nThe celebration will take
  place around Cabana's iconic pool\, offering stunning waterfront views an
 d one of Toronto's most beautiful summer sunsets.\nTo preserve the elegant
  cocktail atmosphere of the evening\, swimming in the pool is not permitte
 d.\n🎶 Entertainment by DJ Gregory Jay\nOur favourite DJ returns with hi
 s signature mix of French and international sounds to keep the energy high
  throughout the evening.\n🇫🇷 Dress Code: Bleu\, Blanc & Rouge\nCeleb
 rate in tricolour style and wear blue\, white and/or red. Elegant summer a
 ttire is encouraged.(no swimming suits- it is a fully dressed elegant even
 ing)\n💃 And yes... we will dance!\n📍 Location\nCabana Pool Bar\n11 P
 olson Street\, Toronto\n☔ Rain Plan\nIn the event of inclement weather\,
  the celebration will move indoors to Noir Room\, conveniently located nex
 t to Cabana Pool Bar. The party will continue rain or shine.\n🥂 Event D
 etails\n• Exclusive guest list\n• Pre-sale tickets only\n• Cash bar 
 featuring curated summer cocktails\n• Professional photographer and vide
 ographer will be on site to capture the evening's highlights and memorable
  moments\n• 19+ event (government-issued photo ID required)\n📱 Follow
  and tag us during the event\nInstagram: @aperochic\n💬 Refund Policy\nT
 ickets are refundable 7 days prior the event (until July 9\, 2026\, at 6:0
 0 PM).\nAfter that date\, tickets become non-refundable but may be transfe
 rred to another guest.\n✨ Bastille Day\, the ApéroChic Way\nRaise a gla
 ss to French heritage\, friendship\, summer and another unforgettable even
 ing on Toronto's waterfront.\nWe look forward to celebrating with you.\nTh
 e ApéroChic Team\nWant to hear about future events? Join the ApéroChic c
 ommunity.
LOCATION:Cabana Waterfront Patio
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/aperochic-bastille-day-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
