 ig screen in our accessible theatre.\nDescription: Socially awkward 17-yea
 r-old cinephile\, Lawrence Kweller\, is self-absorbed and movie-obsessed. 
 Fully convinced he can earn $90\,000 to achieve his dream of attending fil
 m school at NYU\, he gets a part-time job at Sequels video store. There ol
 der store manager\, Alana\, takes him under her wing. Meanwhile Lawrence s
 abotages every high school relationship he has with his narcissistic film 
 snobbery. Faced with the impending reality of university life\, Lawrence m
 ust change his ways.\nThis film is rated 14A. 99 minutes. Start time is 6:
 00 pm. Drop in. All are welcome!
