 eloved evil queens\, princesses\, beasts\, singing birds and talking mirro
 rs for an enchanted burlesque parody of your favourite animated fairytale 
 characters. You're invited to PeepshowTO's underground castle for a magica
 l burlesque parody that is sure to end Nakedly Ever After!\nWhen you wish 
