 t you love.  For the first time ever\, the festival runs 11am to 10 pm\, s
 o the spirit of Aloha will carry you all the way into the evening.\nPresen
 ted by Hālau Hula I Ka Lā\, this free\, all-ages celebration is Toronto'
 s original and only Polynesian cultural festival - a full day of breathtak
 ing hula and Polynesian dance performances\, island-inspired vendors\, Pac
 ific flavours and the kind of warmth that makes strangers feel like 'ohana
