BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sororum Presents: An Evening at The Great Gatsby
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260805T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260805T220000
UID:blogto-236031@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/04/original_image395398a6-4195-4594-82e3-27a1e98286
 a8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:An Evening of Theatre\, Culture\, and Connection\nStep into th
 e elegance and intrigue of the Jazz Age as The Sororum invites you to a sp
 ecial cultural evening inspired by the timeless story of The Great Gatsby.
 \nOn August 5th\, we will gather at the iconic CAA Ed Mirvish Theatre for 
 an unforgettable experience featuring the Mirvish production of The Great 
 Gatsby Musical.\nOur evening begins at 4:30 PM with an exclusive private t
 our of the historic theatre\, offering a rare behind-the-scenes look at on
 e of Toronto’s most celebrated performance venues.\nFollowing the tour\,
  The Sororum will arrange a group dinner reservation at a Jazz Bistro Toro
 nto\, providing a relaxed opportunity to gather\, connect\, and enjoy conv
 ersation together before the performance.\nGuests will have the flexibilit
 y to select their preferred meal and pay directly at the restaurant.\nAt 7
 :30 PM\, we will return to the theatre to enjoy the performance together\,
  where orchestra seating has been arranged for our group\, allowing us to 
 fully experience the music\, storytelling\, and atmosphere of this celebra
 ted production.\nInspired by the spirit of the 1920s\, this evening is abo
 ut more than attending the theatre — it is about shared cultural experie
 nces\, meaningful connection\, and the magic that happens when women gathe
 r with intention.\nWhether you love theatre\, literature\, history\, or si
 mply beautiful experiences shared in wonderful company\, this promises to 
 be a memorable evening within The Sororum community.\nEvent Details:\nDate
 : August 5\nArrival Time: 4:15 PM\nPrivate Theatre Tour: 4:30 PM\nGroup Di
 nner\nAt Jazz Bistro Toronto The Sororum will coordinate a group dinner re
 servation following the tour.Participation is optional. Guests will order 
 individually and settle their own bill directly at the restaurant.\nPerfor
 mance: 7:30 PM – The Great Gatsby Musical\nLocation: CAA Ed Mirvish Thea
 tre\, Toronto\nWhat to Expect\n• Exclusive private guided tour of the hi
 storic theatre\n• Group dinner reservation organized by The Sororum\n•
  Flexibility for guests to select and pay for their own meal\n• Orchestr
 a seating for an engaging theatre experience\n• Opportunity to connect w
 ith inspiring women\n• An elegant cultural evening shared in wonderful c
 ompanyImportant Notes\nLimited seating is available for this exclusive exp
 erience.
LOCATION:Ed Mirvish Theatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-sororum-presents-an-evening-at-the-g
 reat-gatsby-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
