 g to experience the timeless charm of Old Town Toronto. This walk will tak
 e you through landmark sights like the vibrant St. Lawrence Market\, past 
 the Flatiron Building\, and through the character-filled streets of Old To
 wn Toronto\, all steeped in history and architectural beauty.\nAlong the w
 ay\, you’ll discover dog-friendly stops\, local cafés\, and patios that
  blend modern flair with historic surroundings. As we walk\, enjoy the ene
 rgy of the neighbourhood brought to life through live performances and the
  creative spirit that makes Old Town Toronto one of the city’s most dyna
 mic cultural hubs.\nBefore or after the walk\, explore our signature Barke
 t Market on Market Street at the St. Lawrence Market with local vendors an
