BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art Socials: Printmaking: Letterpress Postcards from Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260811T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260811T203000
UID:blogto-235689@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/28/original_image9e6cf239-a63b-42c3-b259-74d1733d4c
 37.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Trade your usual night out for an evening of creative experime
 ntation and social connection! Our weekly beginner-friendly Art Socials in
 vite you to try hands-on creative techniques. This workshop will be someth
 ing to write home about! Print your own letterpress postcards using two an
 tique platen presses set up with an image and text. Learn about traditiona
 l typesetting from wood and metal type\, how it was used historically and 
 how it can still be used today. Add colour to your image and write on your
  postcard to share your favourite memory of your Toronto summer with a fri
 end or loved one. Come solo or with friends\, and leave with something you
