BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Neonatal World Conference 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260822T060000
UID:blogto-229751@blogto.com
DESCRIPTION:Neonatal World Conference 2026\, August 21–23\, 2026 | Dubai
 \, UAE & Virtual\nPrecision Global Conferences warmly invites you to the N
 eonatal World Conference (NEO 2026)\, scheduled to take place from August 
 21 to 23\, 2026\, in Dubai\, UAE\, with a comprehensive hybrid format allo
 wing both in-person and virtual participation.\nThis premier global forum 
 will unite neonatologists\, pediatricians\, researchers\, nurses\, midwive
 s\, public health professionals\, and healthcare innovators dedicated to a
 dvancing neonatal care and improving survival and long-term outcomes for n
 ewborns worldwide.\nConference Theme :  “Frontiers in Neonatology: Beyon
 d Survival to Success”\nNeonatal World conference 2026 With neonatal con
 ditions remaining a leading cause of under-five mortality globally\, and w
 ith increasing challenges related to preterm birth\, low birth weight\, ne
 onatal infections\, congenital disorders\, and health inequities\, the nee
 d for innovation and collaboration in neonatal care has never been more cr
 itical. NEO 2026 provides a timely and essential platform to address neona
 tal health across the continuum—from basic science and cutting-edge clin
 ical interventions to health systems strengthening and policy implementati
 on.\n🔗 Quick Links\n🔗 More Information:\nhttps://www.neonatalconfere
 nce.precisionglobalcon.com/\n🔗 Submit Abstracts:\nhttps://www.neonatalc
 onference.precisionglobalcon.com/abstract-submission.php\n🔗 Register No
 w:\nhttps://www.neonatalconference.precisionglobalcon.com/registration.php
