 obal educational summit dedicated to advancing knowledge and practice acro
 ss the entire spectrum of cardiovascular care. Designed to rotate across c
 ontinents and delivered in a hybrid format\, WCC 2026 brings together lead
 ing voices in cardiology\, cardiovascular surgery\, cardiac imaging\, inte
 rventional techniques\, heart failure management\, and preventive cardiolo
 gy. The conference will be hosted from 23 to 25 August in Dubai and will b
 e accessible worldwide through a robust virtual platform. WCC 2026 ensures
  inclusive participation regardless of geography.\nIn an era where heart d
 isease remains the leading cause of death worldwide\, the conference addre
 sses the critical need for collaborative\, multidisciplinary dialogue to r
 educe the global burden of cardiovascular disease.
